Does this problem exist with this list only?  If so, you may want to
contact the mailing list manager and ask if he/she can check the log
files to find out if your settings are wrong.  It is very unlikely
that you're subscribed twice with the same email address since most
mailing list software will refuse multiple requests for subscription
from the same account.


